 "notes": "Shore dive at the Dreischor pumping station: entry by the steps and rope on the dike, a shallow plateau, then along the dike to the south-east to the overgrown pipes and beams of the gemaal outlet from about 5 m, about ten minutes' swim from the entry. Shoreline from OpenStreetMap; the 10/15/20 m contours follow the neighbouring Frans Kokrif map and every position is approximate. Not placed for lack of a position: the remains of a rowing boat on the plateau, the small hill on the way south-east and the toilet near the outlet.",
